{
    "pageid": 2000,
    "title": "Demesne income",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "A large part of your income , especially in a small realm, comes from the personal holdings of your demesne ."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The Base Holding Income is the sum of:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "the Base Income of the holding: 0.5 for a tribe , 4 for a castle , 8 for a temple , or 12 for a city .",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "the Building Income brought by all buildings constructed in the holding",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Local Income Modifiers include province and holding modifiers. They include:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Technology boost from \"Castle Infrastructure\" tech (up to +50%) and \"Cities and Temples\" tech (up to 40%).",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Muslim Infidel tax on non-Muslim provinces: +25%",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Steward 's Collect Taxes job, which depends on Steward's stewardship attribute: +2.5% tax/skill point. Note that it only applies to holdings owned by the Steward's liege, so they are best used in counties where the liege owns more than one holding.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Wrong government type penalty of -75%, in case the owner's government type does not match the holding type.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Looted province penalty, if a province has been raided or hostile armies lived off loot for supply",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "New administration penalty of -30%",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Recently conquered penalty of -100%",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Prosperity",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Owner Income Modifiers include:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "State stewardship , +2% per point",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "For Muslims, decadence above 25% decreases demesne income, while decadence below 25% increases it.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Modifiers confusingly called \"National Tax Modifier\", such as:",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Greedy (+10%)",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Expelled Jews (-10%)",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "A penalty of -25% per holding above the demesne limit , with a maximum of -90%.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "table",
                    "rows": [
                        [
                            "Exceeding Demesne limit",
                            "By 1",
                            "By 2",
                            "By 3",
                            "By 4 and above"
                        ],
                        [
                            "Income penalty",
                            "-25%",
                            "-50%",
                            "-75%",
                            "-90%"
                        ]
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}